      "source_tier": 1,
      "title": "takanashi_kiara_(casual)",
      "excerpt": "The 2nd [[official alternate costume|costume]] of [[hololive English|hololive EN]]'s [[Takanashi Kiara]].\r\n\r\nIt consists of a [[straw hat|straw]] [[sun hat]], an [[aqua choker|aqua]] [[pendant choker]], a [[cropped shirt|cropped]] [[white shirt|white]] [[short sleeves|short-sleeved]] [[see-through shirt|see-through]] [[blouse]] with an [[aqua bikini|aqua]] [[bikini top only|bikini top]] [[bikini under clothes|underneath]] [[blue shorts]] and [[white sandals|white]] [[gladiator sandals]]. She also has optional [[cat ears]] and [[cat tail|tail]].\r\n\r\nOn March 2024, Kiara received a \"[[Frogiwawa]] [[hood]]\" accessory update for this costume. However, the way the hood perfectly covered her [[bikini]] makes it appeared as if she's [[topless female|topless]].\r\n\r\nFor her [[official alternate hairstyle|official hairstyle]] in this costume, she has her [[medium hair|medium-length hair]] tied into [[low twintails|low]] [[low twin braids|twin braids]] with [[swept bangs]] and [[hair flaps]], decorated with a [[white hairband]].\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !asset #19720649: Profile",
      "captured_at": "2026-08-31"
    },
    {
      "id": "gelbooru:wiki:takanashi_kiara_(casual)",
      "source_site": "gelbooru",
      "source_kind": "wiki",
      "source_key": "takanashi_kiara_(casual)",
      "source_url": "https://gelbooru.com/index.php?page=wiki&s=view&id=takanashi_kiara_(casual)",
      "source_tier": 1,
      "title": "takanashi_kiara_(casual)",
      "excerpt": "The second [[official alternate costume|costume]] of [[hololive English]]'s [[Takanashi Kiara]], as seen in post #4503562.\r\n\r\nIt consists of a [[straw hat|straw]] [[sun hat]], an [[aqua choker|aqua]] [[pendant choker]], a [[white shirt|white]] [[short sleeves|short-sleeved]] [[see-through shirt|see-through]] [[blouse]] with an [[aqua bikini|aqua]] [[bikini top only|bikini top]] [[bikini under clothes|underneath]] [[blue shorts]] and [[white footwear|white]] [[gladiator sandals]]. She also has optional [[cat ears]] and [[cat tail|tail]].\r\n\r\nOn March 2024, Kiara received a \"[[Frogiwawa]] [[hood]]\" accessory update for this costume. However, the way the hood perfectly covered her [[bikini]] makes it appeared as if she's [[topless]].\r\n\r\nHer [[official alternate hairstyle|official hairstyle]] with this attire is [[low twintails|low]] [[low twin braids|twin braids]] with [[swept bangs]] and [[hair flaps]], decorated with a [[white hairband]].",
      "captured_at": "2026-08-31"
    }
  ],
